10:Tac8,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"CreativeWork","name":"ミュージカル『テニスの王子様』The Imperial Match 氷帝学園","description":"関東大会初戦、200名超の部員を擁する強豪・氷帝学園と青学が激突。絶対的カリスマ・跡部景吾率いる氷帝は徹底した実力主義の精鋭集団。加藤和樹演じる跡部の圧倒的存在感と、斎藤工演じる忍足侑士の知的なプレーが話題を呼んだ、テニミュ人気を決定づけた公演。","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/tennimu-1st-hyotei","keywords":"群像・チーム感, 青春・熱量, ジャンプ原作, 学園要素","about":"ミュージカル『テニスの王子様』1st シーズン（テニミュ1st）","actor":[{"@type":"Person","name":"柳 浩太郎","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/yanagi-kotaro"},{"@type":"Person","name":"城田 優","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/shirota-yu"},{"@type":"Person","name":"鈴木 裕樹","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/suzuki-hiroki1"},{"@type":"Person","name":"相葉 裕樹（相葉弘樹）","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/aiba-hiroki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"足立 理","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/adachi-osamu"},{"@type":"Person","name":"新木 宏典（ 荒木宏文）","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/araki-hirofumi"},{"@type":"Person","name":"小谷 嘉一","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kotani-yoshikazu"},{"@type":"Person","name":"加治 将樹","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kaji-masaki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"鯨井 康介","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kujirai-kosuke"},{"@type":"Person","name":"石橋 裕輔（YU-SUKE）","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/ishibashi-yusuke"},{"@type":"Person","name":"豊永 利行","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/toyonaga-toshiyuki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"堀田 勝","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/hotta-masaru"},{"@type":"Person","name":"加藤 和樹","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kato-kazuki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"斎藤 工","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/saito-takumi"},{"@type":"Person","name":"青柳 塁斗","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/aoyagi-ruito"},{"@type":"Person","name":"鎌苅 健太","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kamakari-kenta"},{"@type":"Person","name":"鷹臣（Takuya/今間卓也/矢吹卓也）","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/takaomi"},{"@type":"Person","name":"鷲見 亮","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/washimi-ryo"},{"@ty